type: dataset
title: "China Provincial TOU Tariff Dataset"
abstract: >-
  Time-of-use electricity tariffs for 32 provincial-level regions in China,
  including peak/flat/valley price levels, seasonal period tables, demand
  charges, recommended battery charging-cycle modes, demand-response subsidy
  standards, and the policy document citation for each region.
